{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_012mam_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_012mam_8000_place", "source_sha256": "7e86c711772f2b68a2ca64a5b483509a398ffe36fb0088ed2832ae65221a55a9", "ja": "闇の病院", "zh": "黑暗医院", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_012mam_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_012mam_8001_p", "source_sha256": "c08e6e01d90196dec237aa91deba5738974f94625ffe24718b0b51e82ef584f3", "ja": "（今日はアイドル雑誌『ViDaVo!』の撮影だ。\n真美のテーマは『闇の病院で働くナース』だが）", "zh": "（今天是偶像杂志《ViDaVo!》的拍摄日。\n真美的主题是“在黑暗医院工作的护士”，不过……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_012mam_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_012mam_8002_012mam", "source_sha256": "6265600c78a898436ff323ef4f5e55ed46f3978bcf25136acdd25361e103b84f", "ja": "ヤミヤミヤミ～！　ミーは闇ナースだヤミ～！\n今宵もミ～んなを恐怖の底に引きずり込むヤミ～！", "zh": "黑暗黑暗黑暗～！本小姐是黑暗护士哟～！\n今夜也要把所有人拖入恐惧的深渊哟～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_012mam_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_012mam_8003_p", "source_sha256": "2d601f01b2bbc94f938d142bd6402c1fcb19dee881516307656a35a844a4d0c9", "ja": "ま、真美！　それはかなり違う！　かなり認識が\nズレている！　怪人じゃないんだぞ！？", "zh": "真、真美！完全不对！认识差得\n太远了！又不是什么怪人！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_012mam_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_012mam_8004_012mam", "source_sha256": "102928d4f8582386db48aba387595c9a0ed56bc632f62ce7c14b50f00f9a5ffb", "ja": "えー、そうなの？　せっかく昔のビデオとかで勉強した\nのに。夜な夜な患者さんを消してくナースじゃないの？", "zh": "诶——是这样吗？人家还特意看了以前的录像学习呢。不是那种每到夜里就把患者消灭掉的护士吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_012mam_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_012mam_8005_p", "source_sha256": "35d345172b4c2f2576d24c515a37198eefcff64146259666b4dc36ac93b57743", "ja": "どんなビデオを見たんだ。グラビア企画だからな！？\nダークな中にも妖しげな可愛さが欲しいんだよ。", "zh": "你到底看了什么视频啊。明明是写真企划吧！？\n我想要的是黑暗中也透着几分妖媚可爱的感觉。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_012mam_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_012mam_8006_012mam", "source_sha256": "c03737f49563786626d42a673b4fd140fe697575ba335f5da97f7b897b92404f", "ja": "ふむふむ、真美のカワイさに、ダークさと妖しさと\nセクシーさまで盛りたいだなんて、欲しがりですなぁ。", "zh": "嗯嗯，居然还想在真美的可爱上，再增添黑暗、妖异和性感，真是贪心呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_012mam_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_012mam_8007_p", "source_sha256": "c4890af630fac7fd799eb948b3dbd49354c4e5169303a884ed0016aa9f843c64", "ja": "……まあ、患者はオバケだからアクの強さも必要か。\nオーダーを出すから、試しに演じてみてくれるか？", "zh": "……也是，毕竟患者是幽灵，确实也需要些鲜明的个性啊。\n我来提要求，你先试着演演看好吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_012mam_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_012mam_8008_012mam", "source_sha256": "e0ffff6707ac866e5cfee0bdc082e22ec93ffe62bb0df6a5542ea8e2b8606703", "ja": "おっけー！　任せてちょ♪", "zh": "好的！交给我吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_012mam_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_012mam_8009", "source_sha256": "0ca5a176c459a20f2e87736bc1e7596f5273388b216359bb05d359e7cedfee1c", "ja": "患者さんに注射", "zh": "给患者打针", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_012mam_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_012mam_8010", "source_sha256": "076f73f94b2f3ba00d40e0d9680582834ec524a2ff230da8bb1d69583f83a27e", "ja": "真夜中のナースコール", "zh": "午夜的护士呼叫", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_012mam_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_012mam_8011", "source_sha256": "7cd29db13d856999a0c45ae2152809976d507ae6503a3ba7e366f0ec992b7eae", "ja": "緊急オペの後", "zh": "紧急行动后", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_012mam_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_012mam_8100_p", "source_sha256": "e6bd2a5d6265f08164b9328c756651095f3aa077866116c379f947766c57608d", "ja": "患者さんに妖しげな感じで注射してみよう。\nできるか？", "zh": "试着用神秘兮兮的感觉给患者打针吧。\n做得到吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_012mam_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_012mam_8101_012mam", "source_sha256": "ca745752944808a42dd57247ffb16a7d2b969c7d0f31b8f85e0ef6175ce3d035", "ja": "「ふふ……では患者さん、腕を出してください。\nチクっとしますよ～。……はい、終わりです」", "zh": "「呵呵……那么，病人，请把手伸出来。\n会有一点刺痛哦～……好了，结束了」", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_012mam_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_012mam_8102_p", "source_sha256": "1f832c6db7d1951a8e7eba9c8d6450638cab4b955b4dbdd53dd5735523c4e3fd", "ja": "お！　いいぞいいぞ！　感じが出てる！", "zh": "哦！不错不错！感觉出来了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_012mam_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_012mam_8103_012mam", "source_sha256": "8852911ca38a949d653edf2ace4ffc045f1216c430e0d41db4f8b97771c4d5a5", "ja": "「えっ、胸が痛い？　成功ですね♪　これであなたは\n真美だけのトリコとなりました。うふふ……♪」", "zh": "“诶，胸口疼？成功了呢♪这样一来，你就成了只属于真美的俘虏。嘿嘿……♪”", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_012mam_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_012mam_8200_p", "source_sha256": "c6c87f50bf1ba560f59f4a94f51368376786518e7c2a37e5a0ccffe3a919f6c5", "ja": "真夜中にナースコールがかかってきたら……？", "zh": "如果半夜响起了护士呼叫铃……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_012mam_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_012mam_8201_012mam", "source_sha256": "61f8e30cb7fb8bddcca9590f9f563a5f9d362ee279853e04a77589bed79b0934", "ja": "あ、それって誰もいない部屋からってやつ？\nまさにオバケのしわざっしょ～♪", "zh": "啊，你是说从没有人的房间里打来的那种？\n那正是幽灵搞的鬼吧～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_012mam_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_012mam_8202_012mam", "source_sha256": "a02e667554edc1f0318e5e124219568069aa6a08d2ff12ff3ba0b94b9709b612", "ja": "「もう、しつこいオバケさんですね？　オイタは\nダメですよ～、くらえ、オバケ撃退スプレー！」", "zh": "“真是的，这只幽灵先生还真执着呢？可不能\n恶作剧哦～，看招，幽灵击退喷雾！”", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_012mam_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_012mam_8203_p", "source_sha256": "45e0a23d1877fd5b056bc808b2499d9f7aaf649f78e10c3e9b68dc72b029688d", "ja": "（倒していいんだっけ）", "zh": "（这样打倒它没问题吧？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_012mam_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_012mam_8204_012mam", "source_sha256": "dee114ce809bf86b785a2642b159eb0d2351a11bef38f072b791892a195b6e5e", "ja": "ね？　真美に任せておけば、万事解決だよ☆", "zh": "对吧？交给真美的话，保证一切都能解决☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_012mam_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_012mam_8300_p", "source_sha256": "31a9e7a2f65f32872c7b847a02eb99b7cc13b8e483106b9cd91d2b73d4808cc7", "ja": "緊急オペの後だ。手術の甲斐あって、幸い患者は\n一命を取り留めた……というシチュエーションで……。", "zh": "这是紧急手术之后。多亏了手术，患者幸运地保住了性命……这样的情境……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_012mam_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_012mam_8301_012mam", "source_sha256": "ca629831fea6fd7c13eb8b74bf9328ba483207ae3034c124d84e4a762f41a47c", "ja": "「よかった。でも……はぁ、寂しいわ。貴方のあの\n苦しそうなカオが、もう見られないなんて。……あ」", "zh": "「太好了。不过……唉，真寂寞啊。再也看不到你那张痛苦的脸了。……啊」", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_012mam_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_012mam_8302_p", "source_sha256": "7bae406f7c5a9bb260037d4b13c4364e19cabe3793102bca2827627b9cc58940", "ja": "（え……これは……）", "zh": "（诶……这是……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_012mam_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_012mam_8303_012mam", "source_sha256": "2f4c7461246db183a4a3656fc6318b19d80891f466e6f5619d5a5e4b2f0afa1d", "ja": "……え、兄ちゃん？　黙っちゃってどうしたの？\n今の真美、迫真すぎた？？", "zh": "……咦，哥？你怎么不说话了？\n刚才真美演得太逼真了吗？？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_012mam_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_012mam_8304_p", "source_sha256": "af8906c8d52c54ce24742202b130558c49cac23b2c2e6e2736d960bbfb9311c5", "ja": "うん、すごく……。ホラードラマとかだったら\n会心の演技だったから……惜しいな。すごく惜しい。", "zh": "嗯，非常……要是在恐怖电视剧里，那绝对是精彩至极的演技……真可惜啊。太可惜了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
